msgid "Edits are staged locally. Toggle On/Off, edit the admin comment, add or remove rows, then click Apply updates to commit everything at once. Disabled rows are retained for reference but are NOT delivered to VDIs. Admin comments are internal only and never sent to a VDI or shown to end users."
